q=A.aj(["kategori",a0,"rozet","%10 HIZ TOLERANSI","rozetRenk",B.aT,"ikon",B.e0,"q",q,"a",a4?"Evet, KKTC'deki t\xfcm sabit h\u0131z kameralar\u0131nda yasal h\u0131z s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n\u0131n \xfczerine %10 tolerans pay\u0131 tan\u0131nmaktad\u0131r:\n\n\u2022 50 km/s \u015eehir \u0130\xe7i: 56 km/s ve \xfczeri h\u0131zlarda ceza yaz\u0131l\u0131r.\n\u2022 65 km/s \xc7evre Yolu: 72 km/s ve \xfczeri h\u0131zlarda ceza yaz\u0131l\u0131r.\n\u2022 75 km/s B\xf6l\xfcnm\xfc\u015f Anayol: 83 km/s ve \xfczeri h\u0131zlarda ceza yaz\u0131l\u0131r.\n\u2022 90 km/s Otoyol (Ercan / Ma\u011fusa): 100 km/s ve \xfczeri h\u0131zlarda ceza yaz\u0131l\u0131r.\n\nRadar kameralar\u0131 hem g\xfcnd\xfcz hem gece \xe7ift y\xf6nl\xfc telemetri ve fla\u015fl\u0131 plaka alg\u0131lama yapmaktad\u0131r.":"Yes, a 10% speed tolerance is officially applied. For example, in a 65 km/h zone, tickets are triggered at 72 km/h and above. Speed limits: 50 km/h (urban), 75 km/h (intercity), 90 km/h (motorway)."],s,r)
