p=a4?"Polis \xe7evirmesinde fiziksel ruhsat ta\u015f\u0131mak zorunda m\u0131y\u0131m? E-Denetim QR nedir?":"Do I need physical vehicle registration at police checkpoints?"
p=A.aj(["kategori",a1,"rozet","RESM\u0130 BELGE","rozetRenk",B.fT,"ikon",B.hi,"q",p,"a",a4?"Hay\u0131r, alt men\xfcdeki 'E-Denetim' sekmesinden olu\u015fturaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131z resmi karekodlu dijital s\xfcr\xfcc\xfc ve ara\xe7 belgesi, KKTC Polis Genel M\xfcd\xfcrl\xfc\u011f\xfc (PGM) ve Bay\u0131nd\u0131rl\u0131k ve Ula\u015ft\u0131rma Bakanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 nezdinde ge\xe7erli resmi dijital belgedir.\n\nG\xf6revli polis ekipleri bu dinamik QR kodu kendi el terminalleriyle taratarak ruhsat, muayene ge\xe7erlili\u011fi, sigorta poli\xe7esi ve s\xfcr\xfcc\xfc ceza puan\u0131 durumunuzu anl\u0131k olarak kamu sunucular\u0131ndan teyit edebilir.":"No, the dynamic QR document generated in the 'E-Denetim' tab is officially recognized by the TRNC Police (PGM). Officers scan this QR code to verify registration, insurance, and license points instantly."],s,r)
a4=c.a.c
o=a4?"Radar kameras\u0131 foto\u011fraf\u0131m\u0131 ve kan\u0131t g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcs\xfcn\xfc nas\u0131l inceleyebilirim?":"How can I view the radar camera violation photo and telemetry evidence?"
o=A.aj(["kategori",b,"rozet","KR\u0130PTOLU DEL\u0130L","rozetRenk",B.ek,"ikon",B.QJ,"q",o,"a",a4?"Cezalar sekmesindeki ihlal kart\u0131n\u0131n alt\u0131nda yer alan 'Delil \u0130ncele' butonuna veya Ana Men\xfcdeki 'Radar Foto\u011fraf\u0131 & Kan\u0131t \u0130nceleme' ekran\u0131na t\u0131klayarak ihlal an\u0131n\u0131n y\xfcksek \xe7\xf6z\xfcn\xfcrl\xfckl\xfc radar foto\u011fraf\u0131n\u0131, ara\xe7 plaka yak\u0131nla\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131n\u0131, radar\u0131n \xf6l\xe7t\xfc\u011f\xfc tam h\u0131z telemetrisini ve PGM tebli\u011f numaras\u0131n\u0131 kriptolu olarak g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleyebilirsiniz.":"Click 'Delil \u0130ncele' on your ticket card or go to Menu \u2794 'Radar Photography & Evidence' to view the camera snapshot, plate crop, measured radar speed and official teblig number."],s,r)
a4=c.a.c
n=a4?"Seyr\xfcsefer harc\u0131m\u0131 online \xf6deyebilir miyim? Gecikirse ne olur?":"Can I pay vehicle road tax (seyr\xfcsefer) online? What are late penalties?"
n=A.aj(["kategori",a2,"rozet","ONL\u0130NE HAR\xc7","rozetRenk",B.u0,"ikon",B.pf,"q",n,"a",a4?"Evet, 'Cezalar & Sigorta' ekran\u0131ndaki 'Seyr\xfcsefer' sekmesine ge\xe7erek kredi kart\u0131n\u0131zla g\xfcvenli resmi \xf6deme yapabilirsiniz. \xd6deme an\u0131nda barkodlu onay makbuzu \xfcretilir.\n\nSeyr\xfcsefer s\xfcresi ge\xe7en ara\xe7lara her ay i\xe7in %2 ila %5 aras\u0131nda gecikme faizi uygulan\u0131r. Seyr\xfcsefersiz ara\xe7 kullan\u0131lmas\u0131 halinde polis taraf\u0131ndan ara\xe7 trafikten men edilebilir ve y\xfcksek para cezas\u0131 kesilir.":"Yes, you can renew your road tax online via the 'Seyr\xfcsefer' tab. A certified barcode receipt is generated. Late renewals incur monthly interest and driving without valid road tax leads to vehicle impoundment."],s,r)
a4=c.a.c
m=a4?"Ara\xe7 fenni muayene tarihini nas\u0131l takip ederim? Cezas\u0131 nedir?":"How do I check my vehicle technical inspection date (fenni muayene)?"
m=A.aj(["kategori",a2,"rozet","MUAYENE TAKV\u0130M\u0130","rozetRenk",B.ko,"ikon",B.pw,"q",m,"a",a4?"KKTC'de ara\xe7 muayeneleri plakan\u0131n son rakam\u0131na g\xf6re Trafik Dairesi'nin yay\u0131mlad\u0131\u011f\u0131 y\u0131ll\u0131k takvimle belirlenir. Uygulama, kay\u0131tl\u0131 arac\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n muayene biti\u015f tarihine ka\xe7 g\xfcn kald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 canl\u0131 olarak takip eder ve 30 g\xfcn kala uyar\u0131 bildirimi g\xf6nderir.\n\nMuayenesi ge\xe7mi\u015f ara\xe7la trafi\u011fe \xe7\u0131kmak 10 ceza puan\u0131 ve br\xfct asgari \xfccretin %10'u oran\u0131nda para cezas\u0131na tabidir.":"Vehicle inspection schedules are organized by license plate numbers. The app tracks remaining days and sends automatic reminders 30 days prior. Driving without valid inspection results in 10 penalty points and fine."],s,r)
