l=A.aj(["kategori",b,"rozet","HAKEM HEYET\u0130","rozetRenk",B.u8,"ikon",B.pi,"q",l,"a",a4?"Men\xfc \u2794 '\u0130tiraz & Dilek\xe7e \u0130\u015flemleri' b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcne giderek ceza tutana\u011f\u0131 numaras\u0131n\u0131, itiraz gerek\xe7enizi (\xf6rn: ara\xe7 sat\u0131\u015f\u0131, \xe7al\u0131nt\u0131/ikiz plaka, acil sa\u011fl\u0131k durumu, radar cihaz\u0131 kalibrasyon hatas\u0131) belirterek ve kan\u0131t foto\u011fraflar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 ekleyerek Trafik \u0130htilaf Hakem Kurulu'na online resmi itiraz ba\u015fvurusu yapabilirsiniz. \u0130tiraz s\xfcresince ceza faizi durdurulur.":"Go to Menu \u2794 'Dispute & Petitions' to submit an official appeal to the Traffic Dispute Commission with ticket number, reason and supporting photos. Penalties are frozen during review."],s,r)
