k=a4?"KKTC 100 Ceza Puan\u0131 sistemi nas\u0131l \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r? Puan\u0131m biterse ne olur?":"How does the TRNC 100 demerit points system work? What if points hit zero?"
k=A.aj(["kategori","Giri\u015f & Puan","rozet","100 TAM PUAN","rozetRenk",B.tq,"ikon",B.vw,"q",k,"a",a4?"T\xfcm KKTC ve ge\xe7erli yabanc\u0131 ehliyet sahipleri 100 tam puanla s\xfcr\xfc\u015fe ba\u015flar. Her kural ihlalinde katsay\u0131ya g\xf6re ceza puan\u0131 d\xfc\u015f\xfcl\xfcr:\n\n\u2022 H\u0131z s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 %20 a\u015fmak: -10 puan\n\u2022 Seyir halinde telefonla konu\u015fmak: -15 puan\n\u2022 K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 \u0131\u015f\u0131k ihlali: -20 puan\n\u2022 Emniyet kemeri takmamak: -10 puan\n\u2022 Alkoll\xfc ara\xe7 kullanmak: -50 ila -100 puan\n\nPuan\u0131 0'a inen s\xfcr\xfcc\xfclerin ehliyetine 3 ay el konulur. \u0130hlal tarihinden sonraki 12 ay i\xe7inde yeni ceza al\u0131nmazsa puanlar eski haline d\xf6ner.":"Drivers start with 100 points. Points are deducted based on severity (speeding: 10, mobile phone: 15, red light: 20). If points drop to zero, driving license is suspended for 3 months."],s,r)
