j=A.aj(["kategori","Giri\u015f & Puan","rozet","EHL\u0130YET NO \u0130LE G\u0130R\u0130\u015e","rozetRenk",B.ts,"ikon",B.p9,"q",j,"a",a4?"Uygulamam\u0131za KKTC S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Ehliyet Numaran\u0131z (\xf6rn: D-849201 veya Kimlik Numaran\u0131z) ve \u015fifreniz ile g\xfcvenli bir \u015fekilde giri\u015f yapabilirsiniz.\n\n\u0130lk kez kullan\u0131yorsan\u0131z giri\u015f ekran\u0131ndaki 'Yeni Kay\u0131t' sekmesinden Ehliyet Numaran\u0131z\u0131, son kullanma tarihini ve telefon numaran\u0131z\u0131 girerek saniyeler i\xe7inde hesab\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 olu\u015fturabilirsiniz. Giri\u015f yapt\u0131ktan sonra ad\u0131n\u0131za kay\u0131tl\u0131 ara\xe7lar, bekleyen radar cezalar\u0131, seyr\xfcsefer ve muayene durumunuz otomatik olarak y\xfcklenir.":"You can securely log in using your Driving License Number (e.g. D-849201 or ID Number) and password.\n\nFirst-time users can create an account via the 'Register' tab by entering their license number, expiry date, and mobile phone. All registered vehicles, radar fines, road tax, and inspection records will load automatically."],s,r)
